sequenceDiagram
  participant A as client A
  participant M as MDS
  participant B as client B
  A->>M: open(report.txt, write)
  M-->>A: write capability + buffer
  A->>A: write to the local cache
  B->>M: open(report.txt, read)
  M->>A: capability recall (revoke)
  A->>A: flush data to the OSDs
  A-->>M: release the capability
  M-->>B: read capability
